      "verification": "DBE national promotion policy (Gazette 36042 as amended to 2015), Tables 4, 17 and 19: the same seven achievement levels for every grade, 7 Outstanding (80-100), 6 Meritorious (70-79), 5 Substantial (60-69), 4 Adequate (50-59), 3 Moderate (40-49), 2 Elementary (30-39), 1 Not achieved (0-29). The policy rounds a final mark half-up (70,3 to 70, 70,6 to 71), so each scheme rounds the total to a whole mark before lookup. The points are the level numbers, not an admission point score."
    }
